{
  "title": "Dua after reciting Holy Quran",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْ قَدْ قَرَاْتُ مَا قَضَيْتَ مِنْ كِتَابِكَ الَّذِيْ اَنْزَلْتَهُ عَلٰى نَبِيِّكَ الصَّادِقِ صَلَّى اللهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ فَلَكَ الْحَمْدُ رَبَّنَا\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE QAD QARA-TU MAA QADAYTA MIN KITAABIKAL LAZEE ANZALTAHU A'LAA NABIYYIKAS SAADIQI SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIHI, FALAKAL HAMDU RABBANAA\nO Allah, I have recited what You have decreed from Your Book, which You sent down upon Your truthful Prophet — Allah's blessings be upon him and his Household — so to You is all praise, our Lord.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْنِيْ مِمَّنْ يُحِلُّ حَلَالَهُ وَ يُحَرِّمُ حَرَامَهُ وَ يُؤْمِنُ بِمُحْكَمِهِ وَ مُتَشَابِهِهِ\nALLAAHUMMAJ A'LNEE MIMMAN YUHILLU HALAALAHU WA YUHARRIMU HARAAMAHU WA YU'MINU BI-MUHKAMIHI WA MUTASHAABIHIH\nO Allah, make me among those who allow what it makes lawful, forbid what it makes unlawful, and believe in its clear and its ambiguous verses,\nوَاجْعَلْهُ لِيْ اُنْسًا فِيْ قَبْرِيْ وَ اُنْسًا فِيْ حَشْرِيْ وَاجْعَلْنِيْ مِمَّنْ تُرَقِّيْهِ بِكُلِّ اٰيَةٍ قَرَاَهَا دَرَجَةً فِيْ اَعْلٰى عِلِّيِّيْنَ\nWAJ-A'LHU LEE UNSAN FEE QABREE WA UNSAN FEE HASHREE WAJ-A'LNEE MIMMAN TURAQQEEHI BI-KULLI AAYATIN QARA-AHAA DARAJATAN FEE A'LAA I'LLIYYEEN\nand make it a companion for me in my grave and a companion at my resurrection, and make me among those whom You raise, for every verse recited, a rank in the highest Illiyyin,\nاٰمِيْنَ رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nAAMEEN RABBAL A'AALAMEEN\nAmeen, Lord of the worlds."
}
